
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>KYAWSOE | Building the Future</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #080b14;
      color: white;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header {
      padding: 20px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: #111827;
    }
    .logo { color: #e4c477; font-size: 25px; font-weight: bold; }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 14px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .hero {
      min-height: 75vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 35px 20px;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, #1c3153, #080b14 70%);
    }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 9vw, 75px); line-height: 1.15; }
    .gold { color: #e4c477; }
    .hero p { max-width: 520px; color: #c3cada; margin: 22px 0; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e4c477;
      color: #080b14;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    section { padding: 65px 8%; text-align: center; }
    section h2 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    .muted { color: #b7c0d1; }
    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
    .card {
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: left;
      border: 1px solid #28344b;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #111827;
    }
    .card h3 { color: #e4c477; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    footer {
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #111827;
      color: #b7c0d1;
    }
    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      header { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
      nav a { margin: 0 6px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">KYAWSOE.</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero" id="home">
      <p class="gold">INNOVATION • TECHNOLOGY • FUTURE</p>
      <h1>Building the<br><span class="gold">Future.</span></h1>
      <p>Welcome to KYAWSOE. Discover new ideas, modern technology, and exciting digital possibilities.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="#about">Explore Our Company →</a>
    </div>

    <section id="about">
      <h2>About KYAWSOE</h2>
      <p class="muted">A modern digital brand focused on creativity, technology, and a better online future.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <h2>What We Do</h2>
      <p class="muted">Ideas that move the digital world forward.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Web Development</h3>
          <p class="muted">Responsive websites for phones, tablets, and computers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Innovation</h3>
          <p class="muted">Creative ideas and new possibilities for the future.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Digital Solutions</h3>
          <p class="muted">Explore digital tools that make online experiences better.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <h2>Let's Connect</h2>
      <p class="muted">Have an idea? We would love to hear from you.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:22px">
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@example.com">Contact Us</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 KYAWSOE. All rights reserved.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
